            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>FMD, angiographically demonstrated as a string of beads is descripted in etiology, manifestation, clinical findings, proceeding and therapy. Nine cases under 500 unselected cerebral angiograms are reported which means 1.8% of all angiograms we have performed. Another hypothesis to etiology is given.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
